# frontage.optersoft.com has been the academy's Frontage section since 2026-09-06: the
# landing page and the examples live at academy.optersoft.com/python/frontage. This Pages
# project keeps what is fetched by URL: the wheels at /dist/ (every `pyscript.json` and the
# academy's live examples name one) and the playground, with the package and the PyScript
# bundle it loads. PyScript's offline mode resolves its interpreters as ./pyscript/<name>/…
# relative to the page, hence the rewrite (a 200 is a rewrite, not a redirect).
/  https://academy.optersoft.com/python/frontage  301
/examples  https://academy.optersoft.com/python/frontage/examples  301
/examples/*  https://academy.optersoft.com/python/frontage/examples  301
/playground/pyscript/* /pyscript/:splat 200
